      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISTER ANATOLY (1) was fresh up last time at this track where he finished seventh (23.15) in a NG. Will strip fitter for the run. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from three starts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. MARK TO MARKET (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (18.81) last time in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Has ability and can atone. LUCKY LINKS (4) stalked the lead from the inside draw before finishing second last start (18.58) at this track in Grade 4/5 over 320m. Has a strong record from box 4, including two wins. Must be included in calculations. HOVERING (7) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
